\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My heart is fixed, eternal God,
\par Fixed on Thee:
\par And my immortal choice is made:
\par Christ for me.
\par He is my Prophet, Priest, and King,
\par Who did  for me salvation bring,
\par And while I've breath I mean to sing:
\par Christ for me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In Him I see the Godhead shine;
\par Christ for me.
\par He is the Majesty Divine;
\par Christ for me.
\par The Father's well-beloved Son,
\par Co-partner of His royal throne,
\par Who did for human guilt atone:
\par Christ for me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. In pining sickness or in health,
\par Christ for me.
\par In deepest poverty or wealth,
\par Christ for me.
\par And in that all-important day,
\par When I the summons must obey,
\par And pass from this dark world away,
\par Christ for me.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

